2. Create the RAG Flowchart

PDF → Text → Chunks → Embeddings → ChromaDB → Retrieval → LLM → Answer. 
PDF → Upload the document.
Text → Extract readable text from the PDF.
Chunks → Divide large text into smaller pieces.
Embeddings → Convert each chunk into numbers.
ChromaDB → Store the embeddings.
Retrieval → Find the most relevant chunks.
LLM → Generate the answer using the retrieved information.
Answer → Display the final response to the user. 

3. Python Libraries Required for RAG
Library	Purpose
PyPDF2	Reads and extracts text from PDF files
Sentence Transformers	Creates text embeddings
ChromaDB	Stores embeddings and performs similarity search
FAISS	Performs fast similarity search
OpenAI SDK	Connects the Python program with an LLM
